  "notes": "COMPOUNDS:\n{社交|しゃこう} (social intercourse) + {的|てき} (suffix: -like, -ish)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {社交的|しゃこうてき} (sociable) ↔ {非社交的|ひしゃこうてき} (unsociable)\n- {外向的|がいこうてき} (extroverted) ↔ {内向的|ないこうてき} (introverted)\n\nUSAGE:\n{社交的|しゃこうてき} emphasizes social skills and enjoyment of social interaction, while {外向的|がいこうてき} is a broader psychological term about drawing energy from external interaction.\n\nFORMS:\n{社交的|しゃこうてき}に - sociably",
